WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.360
ReadyIQ turns a credit challenge into a clear path back to the mortgage conversation.

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:17.374
It starts with one personal link. The loan officer can text it, email it, or print the QR code. Every response stays connected to them.

00:00:17.924 --> 00:00:28.676
With permission, the consumer enters a private workspace, sees all three credit bureaus, and gets a clear starting point. The lender never sees the private report.

00:00:29.226 --> 00:00:38.442
ReadyIQ turns that information into a simple game plan. Each step explains what to do, why it matters, and what comes next.

00:00:38.992 --> 00:00:51.184
If something looks inaccurate, the Dispute Hub makes it manageable. Review one item, explain the issue, add support, and create the letter. Nothing is sent without approval.

00:00:51.734 --> 00:01:00.062
Scores, responses, milestones, and completed actions stay together, so progress and the next step are always clear.

00:01:00.612 --> 00:01:10.668
Back in the lender portal, the team sees approved milestones, not private credit. They know who is working, who may need help, and who requested a review.

00:01:11.218 --> 00:01:19.354
When the consumer is ready, ReadyIQ routes that moment back to the original loan officer, with context for a helpful follow-up.

00:01:19.904 --> 00:01:25.976
One connected journey, from not ready yet to ready to talk. ReadyIQ.
